      "content": "the thing is, it's not just about rules. i'm being super careful to follow everything. but it's like there's this weird energetic shift. every time i join, the vibe just goes flat. it feels less like \"moderation\" and more like i'm being shadowbanned by the platform itself. like the system sees my specific profile/vibe and just triggers a suppression loop to keep me from actually connecting with anyone. has anyone ever actually heard of an algorithm doing that? like a deliberate social isolation thing?",
